[{"text": "Last Tuesday, a guy walked into the Supreme Court and officially filed a lawsuit against Time.", "start": 1.107, "end": 5.936, "words": [{"w": "Last", "start": 1.107, "end": 1.385}, {"w": "Tuesday,", "start": 1.4200000000000002, "end": 1.861}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.8840000000000001, "end": 1.9080000000000001}, {"w": "guy", "start": 1.977, "end": 2.151}, {"w": "walked", "start": 2.2209999999999996, "end": 2.488}, {"w": "into", "start": 2.5229999999999997, "end": 2.674}, {"w": "the", "start": 2.7439999999999998, "end": 2.8129999999999997}, {"w": "Supreme", "start": 2.86, "end": 3.2199999999999998}, {"w": "Court", "start": 3.266, "end": 3.51}, {"w": "and", "start": 3.545, "end": 3.614}, {"w": "officially", "start": 3.661, "end": 4.125}, {"w": "filed", "start": 4.194999999999999, "end": 4.484999999999999}, {"w": "a", "start": 4.52, "end": 4.543}, {"w": "lawsuit", "start": 4.6129999999999995, "end": 5.053999999999999}, {"w": "against", "start": 5.0889999999999995, "end": 5.425}, {"w": "Time.", "start": 5.4719999999999995, "end": 5.936}]}, {"text": "His claim? Fraud and unfair business practices.", "start": 5.959, "end": 8.723, "words": [{"w": "His", "start": 5.959, "end": 6.145}, {"w": "claim?", "start": 6.192, "end": 6.598}, {"w": "Fraud", "start": 6.656, "end": 7.016}, {"w": "and", "start": 7.061999999999999, "end": 7.132}, {"w": "unfair", "start": 7.213, "end": 7.561999999999999}, {"w": "business", "start": 7.62, "end": 7.9559999999999995}, {"w": "practices.", "start": 7.991, "end": 8.723}]}, {"text": "Exhibit A: work hours feel like forty days,", "start": 8.781, "end": 11.59, "words": [{"w": "Exhibit", "start": 8.781, "end": 9.257000000000001}, {"w": "A:", "start": 9.338000000000001, "end": 9.675}, {"w": "work", "start": 9.756, "end": 10.011000000000001}, {"w": "hours", "start": 10.069, "end": 10.394}, {"w": "feel", "start": 10.453000000000001, "end": 10.627}, {"w": "like", "start": 10.673, "end": 10.801}, {"w": "forty", "start": 10.847000000000001, "end": 11.126000000000001}, {"w": "days,", "start": 11.196000000000002, "end": 11.59}]}, {"text": "but weekends expire in four seconds flat.", "start": 11.648000000000001, "end": 14.098, "words": [{"w": "but", "start": 11.648000000000001, "end": 11.811}, {"w": "weekends", "start": 11.869000000000002, "end": 12.299000000000001}, {"w": "expire", "start": 12.357000000000001, "end": 12.844000000000001}, {"w": "in", "start": 12.879000000000001, "end": 12.949}, {"w": "four", "start": 13.030000000000001, "end": 13.227}, {"w": "seconds", "start": 13.285, "end": 13.611}, {"w": "flat.", "start": 13.669, "end": 14.098}]}, {"text": "The judge actually subpoenaed Father Time.", "start": 14.121, "end": 16.42, "words": [{"w": "The", "start": 14.121, "end": 14.226}, {"w": "judge", "start": 14.296000000000001, "end": 14.574}, {"w": "actually", "start": 14.621, "end": 15.039000000000001}, {"w": "subpoenaed", "start": 15.097000000000001, "end": 15.619000000000002}, {"w": "Father", "start": 15.689, "end": 15.991000000000001}, {"w": "Time.", "start": 16.049, "end": 16.42}]}, {"text": "But Time didn't show up, stating he was running late.", "start": 16.455000000000002, "end": 19.241, "words": [{"w": "But", "start": 16.455000000000002, "end": 16.606}, {"w": "Time", "start": 16.664, "end": 17.024}, {"w": "didn't", "start": 17.094, "end": 17.372}, {"w": "show", "start": 17.407, "end": 17.628}, {"w": "up,", "start": 17.721, "end": 17.895}, {"w": "stating", "start": 17.929000000000002, "end": 18.266000000000002}, {"w": "he", "start": 18.313000000000002, "end": 18.359}, {"w": "was", "start": 18.405, "end": 18.522000000000002}, {"w": "running", "start": 18.591, "end": 18.847}, {"w": "late.", "start": 18.916, "end": 19.241}]}, {"text": "By default, the judge granted a settlement:", "start": 19.288, "end": 21.308, "words": [{"w": "By", "start": 19.288, "end": 19.439}, {"w": "default,", "start": 19.485, "end": 19.892}, {"w": "the", "start": 19.915, "end": 19.996000000000002}, {"w": "judge", "start": 20.